2. In these Regulations, unless the context otherwise requires —
“deemed protected area” means a protected area under section 4(1) of PAPPA which is deemed by section 85(2)(a) of the Act to be a protected area declared under section 8(1) of the Act;
“deemed protected place” means a protected place under section 5(1) of PAPPA which is deemed by section 85(3)(a) of the Act to be a protected place declared under section 14(1) of the Act;
“PAPPA” means the Protected Areas and Protected Places Act (Cap. 256) repealed by section 84(1) of the Act;
“Section 4 Direction” means a direction given under section 4(2) of PAPPA and in force immediately before 18 December 2018 in respect of a deemed protected area;
“Section 5 Direction” means a direction given under section 5(2) of PAPPA and in force immediately before 18 December 2018 in respect of a deemed protected place.
